1
00:00:00,580 --> 00:00:03,880
(Sheldon:)Complete with bulletproof
bracelets and lasso of truth.

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,650
(Sheldon:)Invisible plane sold separately.

3
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,950
(Penny:)Wait, why me?

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,950
(Penny:)Wh-Why can't your girlfriend
be Wonder Woman?

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,520
(Howard:)She and her lab team
are under quarantine.

6
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,090
(Howard:)Seems at the Christmas party
they were doing Jell-O shots

7
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:20,160
(Howard:)out of petri dishes that used
to contain yellow fever.

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,200
(Penny:)Okay, what about
your friend Amy?

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,300
(Sheldon:)Amy Farrah Fowler doesn't
believe in wearing costumes.

10
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:30,370
(Sheldon:)She isn't the free spirit I am.

11
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,040
(Penny:)Okay, well, forget it.

12
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:35,710
(Penny:)I'm not spending
my New Year's Eve

13
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:38,550
(Penny:)at a comic book store
wearing a Wonder Woman costume.

14
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:43,850
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)He says he'll wear it
if you'll be Aquaman.

15
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

